    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Department of Nursing Education Services offered a five-day COVID-19 online training programme to public sector nurses as part of the University's agreement with the Sindh government on building the capacity of frontline workers in government hospitals. The programme was organised at the Centre for Innovation in Medical Education, CIME.",
